{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-luscious","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Luscious","description":"\u003cp\u003eLuscious Nic Salt Juice offers a bright and uplifting fruit fusion that serves as the perfect choice for those who enjoy smooth and satisfying e-liquid flavors. Frequently praised for its mouthwatering and well-balanced arrangement of watermelon and honeydews flavors, if you’ve been on the hunt for a farm-fresh flavor profile to make your next ADV, you won’t want to miss out on trying this appropriately-titled Luscious Nic Salt Juice by VGOD.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVGOD’s Luscious Nic Salt Juice comes in a 30ml bottle of nicotine salt juice with your choice between a 25mg (2.5%) and 50mg (5.0%) nicotine strength. Not simping for Luscious? Be sure to check out VGOD’s full selection of nicotine salt juices.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Luscious Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWatermelon \u0026amp; melon\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg","offer_id":41670490849335,"sku":"VGOD - Luscious - 25 mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670490882103,"sku":"VGOD - Luscious - 50mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.sh